  <p>To test transfer beyond the synthetic research suite, we evaluate public benchmarks. After two rounds, <strong>score per output token reaches 1.2–1.6× the base model's level</strong> across MLR-Bench, DSBench, ScienceAgentBench, and AstaBench (Figure 3)<dt-cite key="chen2026mlr,jing2025dsbench,chen2025scienceagentbench,bragg2026astabench"></dt-cite>.</p>

