  <h2>Observation 1. Role generalization in RSI</h2>

  <p>We observe that MASS enables role generalization in RSI. <strong> We train the model only on task-solving trajectories and observe that the capabilities of the workflow optimizer and workspace evaluator also improve. </strong> This enables RSI loop to be sustainable.</p>

